# S14 (drop), guest g (k2 with flag 501, set by the lobby's first.lua at the first visit, which the room story
# lacks: the owner's card without it, seed_story): waits at the title until the owner has left, then enters the lobby:
# 501 is new to the room and plausible there.
# Drop refuses it (owner_away) and records it in the room's dropped set; the engine keeps it for the rest of the
# lobby visit (never mid-stage) and the lobby gate's barrier into stag0101 removes it, with the notice.
# (Once the title gives every member the room story at game start, g's 501 is gone there and the scenario needs a
# value g makes in the lobby: k2 without 501 plays the first visit's talk, which stalls in k2's lobby at n_digilff
# #2's ISSEQNAME SQ_WALK02; tried in round S2.)
idle until epoch>=@50
log owner gone
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log in the lobby
idle until frames>=300 fail flag:501=0
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
idle until frames>=120 fail flag:501=1
log 501 removed
idle until frames>=60
